CLASS lhc_storagecond DEFINITION INHERITING FROM cl_abap_behavior_handler.
  PRIVATE SECTION.
    METHODS:
      get_global_authorizations FOR GLOBAL AUTHORIZATION
        IMPORTING
        REQUEST requested_authorizations FOR storagecond
        RESULT result.

    METHODS is_update_granted
      RETURNING VALUE(update_granted) TYPE abap_bool.
ENDCLASS.

CLASS lhc_storagecond IMPLEMENTATION.
  METHOD get_global_authorizations.
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
* Development ID : ZDDE-00097969                                       *
* Functional Spec: ZFSE-00097968                                       *
* Description    : Method get_global_authorizations
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
*  Change Log:                                                         *
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*    Who       Date           CR            Text                       *
*  SHASHJA1   13-MAY-2025    1100271411   Initial Development          *
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
    DATA: lc_id TYPE symsgid VALUE 'ZFSE_00097845',
          lc_1  TYPE symsgno VALUE '001'.
    IF requested_authorizations-%update EQ if_abap_behv=>mk-on.
      IF is_update_granted( ) = abap_true.
        result-%update = if_abap_behv=>auth-allowed.
      ELSE.
        result-%update = if_abap_behv=>auth-unauthorized.
        result-%action-edit = if_abap_behv=>fc-o-disabled.
        APPEND VALUE #( %msg    = new_message( id      = lc_id
                                               number  = lc_1
                                               severity = if_abap_behv_message=>severity-error )
                        %global = if_abap_behv=>mk-on
                      ) TO reported-storagecond.
      ENDIF.
    ENDIF.
  ENDMETHOD.

  METHOD is_update_granted.
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
* Development ID : ZDDE-00097969                                       *
* Functional Spec: ZFSE-00097968                                       *
* Description    : Method is_update_granted
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
*  Change Log:                                                         *
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------*
*    Who       Date           CR            Text                       *
*  SHASHJA1   13-MAY-2025    1100271411   Initial Development          *
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*
* For Creation / Change Activity code "02" is being used.

    AUTHORITY-CHECK OBJECT 'S_TABU_NAM'
         ID 'ACTVT' FIELD '02'
         ID 'TABLE' FIELD  'ZMD_RAUBE'.
    update_granted = COND #( WHEN sy-subrc = 0 THEN abap_true ELSE abap_false ).
  ENDMETHOD.
ENDCLASS.

